      "title": "parse_amount_rupees converts text to paise",
      "description": "Create parse_amount_rupees(amount_text) in expense_manager/parse_amount.py. Accept positive rupee amounts with no decimal point or one or two digits after the decimal point. Reject zero, negative values, and more than two decimal places.\n1. import re, decimal\n2. if re.fullmatch(r\"\\d+(?:\\.\\d{1,2})?\", amount_text) is None: raise ValueError\n3. amount_paise = int(decimal.Decimal(amount_text) * 100)\n4. if amount_paise <= 0: raise ValueError\n5. return amount_paise\n",
      "commit": "feat: parse rupee amounts",
